## External dependencies

This plugin bundles no third-party code. At runtime it uses:

| Dependency                     | Licence      | Why                                          |
|--------------------------------|--------------|----------------------------------------------|
| `brightnessctl`                | MIT          | Reads and sets the backlight level. Ships in the default Omarchy set. |
| `bash`, `coreutils`            | GPL-3.0      | Two one-line helpers for the runtime state file. |
| Quickshell                     | LGPL-3.0     | The shell that hosts the plugin.              |
| Qt 6 / `Qt5Compat.GraphicalEffects` | LGPL-3.0 | `RadialGradient`, used for the vignette. Arch package `qt6-5compat`. |

No code is downloaded, built, or executed from the network. No privileged
commands are used, and no `sudo` or `pkexec` is invoked. The only file written
outside the plugin's own config is a single integer in `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`.
